    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siyoonay, toos oo toos, oo xooggaaga xidho. Yeruusaalemay, magaalada quduuska ahay, dharkaaga quruxda badan xidho, waayo, hadda ka dib kuwa buuryoqab ah iyo kuwa nijaas ah toona kuma ay soo geli doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeruusaalemay, boodhka iska jaf oo ka kac, oo fadhiiso, magaalada Siyoon oo maxbuusad ahayday, iska fur waxa qoorta lagaaga xidhay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Idinka waxaa laydinku iibiyey wax aan waxba ahayn, oo haddana lacagla'aan baa laydinku soo furan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Dadkaygii waa horay Masar ku dhaadheceen inay halkaas joogaan, oo kii reer Ashuurna sababla'aan buu u dulmay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal maxaa halkan ii jira marka dadkayga waxaan waxba ahayn lagu kaxaystay? Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Kuwa iyaga u taliyaa way qayliyaan, oo magacaygana had iyo goor maalin kastaba waa la caayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dadkaygu magacaygay aqoonsan doonaan, oo sidaas daraaddeed waxay maalintaas garan doonaan inaan anigu ahay kan hadla, bal eega, waa i kane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buuraha dushooda ku qurux badanaa cagaha kan warka wanaagsan keena, oo nabadda naadiya, oo waxyaalaha wanaagsan warka wanaagsan ka keena, oo badbaadada naadiya, oo Siyoon ku yidhaahda, Ilaahaagii baa boqornimada haysta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa ka codka waardiyayaashaadu! Codkooday kor u qaadayaan, oo dhammaantood way wada heesayaan, waayo, indhahooday ku arki doonaan markii Rabbigu Siyoon ku soo noqonayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeruusaalem meelaheeda baabba'ayow, dhammaantiin farxa, oo kulligiin hees ku dhufta, waayo, Rabbigu dadkiisii wuu qalbi qaboojiyey, oo Yeruusaalemna wuu soo furtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu gacantiisii quduuska ahayd bayaan ugu muujiyey quruumaha oo dhan hortooda, oo dhulka darafyadiisa oo dhammuna waxay wada arki doonaan badbaadinta Ilaaheenna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna weelasha Rabbiga sidow, taga, oo taga, oo halkaas ka soo baxa, ha taabanina wax aan daahir ahayn, oo iyada ka dhex baxa, oo daahir ahaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, degdeg kuma bixi doontaan oo qixidna kuma carari doontaan, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiga ayaa idin hor kici doona, oo Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil ayaa idin daba socon doona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Silaca Iyo Ammaanta Addoonka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, addoonkaygu caqli buu yeelan doonaa, oo waa la sarraysiin doonaa, oo kor baa loo kicin doonaa, wuxuuna noqon doonaa mid aad u sarreeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa jaahiisii loo xumeeyey si ka daran sida nin kale loo xumeeyo, suuraddiisiina waxaa loo xumeeyey si ka daran sida binu-aadmiga loo xumeeyo oo kale, haddaba sidii kuwa badanu ula yaabi jireen oo kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayuu isaguna quruumo badan uga yaabin doonaa, oo boqorraduna waxay afkooda u xidhi doonaan isaga aawadiis, waayo, waxay arki doonaan wax aan weligood loo sheegin, oo waxay ka fiirsan doonaan wax ayan weligood maqal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
